                    </div>
                    <div class="md:w-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                                <h4 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Mesa de Comedor</h4>
                                <span class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-3 py-1 text-[12px] font-bold rounded">BEST SELLER</span>
                            </div>
                            <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Estructura robusta de nogal con bordes naturales 'live edge'. Cada pieza es única, conservando la silueta original del árbol.</p>
                            <ul class="space-y-2">
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-body-md text-on-surface">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]">verified</span> Madera certificada FSC
                                </li>
